.TH ACL_CHOWN 1 "December 2024" "Network Security" "Lab Commands"
.SH NAME
acl_chown_lab \- chown command quick lab reference
.SH DESCRIPTION
Change ownership of files and directories (Lab Sheet: ACL Exercises).
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B Change owner
chown alice file.txt
.TP
.B Change owner and group
chown alice:staff file.txt
.TP
.B Change recursively
chown -R alice:staff /project/
.SH LAB CHALLENGES
.TP
.B Give ownership of a directory to user bob
chown bob /shared/
.TP
.B Give ownership to user+group recursively
chown -R alice:developers /project/
.SH AUTHOR
Exam preparation cheat-sheet.

